mygo-wallpaper (0.1.4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Bundle the liblcl.so (Lazarus LCL, gtk2) runtime library into the
    package so the GUI can start on a clean system; previously the app
    failed to open on Debian 13 because the library and its GTK2
    dependencies were missing.
  * Declare GTK2 runtime dependencies, using libgtk2.0-0t64 on
    Debian 13 (trixie) with libgtk2.0-0 fallback for older releases.
  * Refresh the dynamic linker cache via postinst/postrm for the
    bundled library.
  * Recommend dbus-x11 (GNOME fallback path) and CJK fonts.
  * CI downloads the matching liblcl runtime (amd64/arm64) before
    building the deb.

 -- gfc <ffgcc45@qq.com>  Sun, 01 Nov 2026 19:00:00 +0800

mygo-wallpaper (0.1.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial package.
  * Support Bing, private wallpaper API, MTphotos API.
  * GUI based on mygo(govcl), support Linux/XinChuang.
  * Support DDE/GXDE wallpaper setting.

